{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobr8olpy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふふ、ようやく"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はディズニー✨✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はこれまで、小学生の頃に一度だけ家族とディズニーランドに行ったことはあったのですが、ディズニーシーは初めてでした！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから6期の皆んなといけたのが嬉しかったな〜^_^♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真もたくさん撮って、笑って、はしゃいで、気づいたらあっという間に時間が過ぎていました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またすぐ行きたいなーーーーー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobVNzHJm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は少しの時間でも空いているときがあったら、6期のメンバーと会って、たくさん遊んだりお話ししたりしてるんです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しでも会わない時間があると、逆にそっちのほうが違和感まできています笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆んなの存在がどれだけ大きくて、どれだけ救われていて、大好きかを感じています😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも写真撮ってくれるの！！ありがとう♡"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobAWHacY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobsjGsAx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みてみて、これ私が撮った可愛い写真"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobphu0lZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私だけのものにしておきたい気もしていたのですが、ブログを見てくださっている皆さんに特別にお届けです✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "晃菜とはですね、今度卓球しに行く予定もあるんです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "体をたくさん動かしに行きます！！！！\n楽しみだなーー。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よし！ここで言ったからには、はやく行きたいな！\n行こうね！ひーーなっ✌🏻😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は短めですが読んでくださり、\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も１日お疲れさまです🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}